    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Real-Time Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react the moment you make a decision\u2014! Fast, tense action with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab11c317208bd5762455bf5fb63d1746.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab11c317208bd5762455bf5fb63d1746.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab11c317208bd5762455bf5fb63d1746.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa 4 Characters with Unique Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with 8 uniques attack types, exclusive animations, and 2 passive traits. Adapt your playstyle for every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab5fa2fbee59214bf79ab911e9ea44bb.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab5fa2fbee59214bf79ab911e9ea44bb.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab5fa2fbee59214bf79ab911e9ea44bb.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Time Limit -\u00a0Think Fast, Strike Faster!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have just 7 minutes to defeat all enemies in each run. You've been relentlessly trained for this moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/f33bc34053f16d0acf3256eb27dc0f2c.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/f33bc34053f16d0acf3256eb27dc0f2c.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/f33bc34053f16d0acf3256eb27dc0f2c.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Item &amp; Trait Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic synergies that activate automatically during battle. Timing and adaptability are the keys to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/b01135879401ad2af7d24432d3b8fdf4.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/b01135879401ad2af7d24432d3b8fdf4.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/b01135879401ad2af7d24432d3b8fdf4.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all 7 maps and the boss in a single run\u2014or get reset! But clearing the same map 3 times unlocks progress. Collect coins, build a stronger deck, and dive back in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/471b6ce4ca0402a302373469c6b664ea.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/471b6ce4ca0402a302373469c6b664ea.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/471b6ce4ca0402a302373469c6b664ea.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Full Controller Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Xbox, DualShock/DualSense, and most xInput/Direct Input controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Auto-Adjusting Resolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supports all screen resolutions, with optional manual settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>12 Languages Supported</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korean, English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Brazilian Portuguese, and Russian.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Real-Time Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react the moment you make a decision\u2014! Fast, tense action with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab11c317208bd5762455bf5fb63d1746.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab11c317208bd5762455bf5fb63d1746.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab11c317208bd5762455bf5fb63d1746.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa 4 Characters with Unique Strategies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with 8 uniques attack types, exclusive animations, and 2 passive traits. Adapt your playstyle for every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab5fa2fbee59214bf79ab911e9ea44bb.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab5fa2fbee59214bf79ab911e9ea44bb.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/ab5fa2fbee59214bf79ab911e9ea44bb.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Time Limit -\u00a0Think Fast, Strike Faster!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have just 7 minutes to defeat all enemies in each run. You've been relentlessly trained for this moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/f33bc34053f16d0acf3256eb27dc0f2c.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/f33bc34053f16d0acf3256eb27dc0f2c.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/f33bc34053f16d0acf3256eb27dc0f2c.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Item &amp; Trait Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic synergies that activate automatically during battle. Timing and adaptability are the keys to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/b01135879401ad2af7d24432d3b8fdf4.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/b01135879401ad2af7d24432d3b8fdf4.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/b01135879401ad2af7d24432d3b8fdf4.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25aa Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all 7 maps and the boss in a single run\u2014or get reset! But clearing the same map 3 times unlocks progress. Collect coins, build a stronger deck, and dive back in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/471b6ce4ca0402a302373469c6b664ea.poster.avif?t=1750816320\" width=606 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/471b6ce4ca0402a302373469c6b664ea.webm?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786930/extras/471b6ce4ca0402a302373469c6b664ea.mp4?t=1750816320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Full Controller Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Xbox, DualShock/DualSense, and most xInput/Direct Input controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Auto-Adjusting Resolution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supports all screen resolutions, with optional manual settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>12 Languages Supported</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korean, English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Brazilian Portuguese, and Russian.</p>",
